  m_text: Surface chart picks are essentially meant to be played alongside, or in
    addition to the in-game main levels. They may provide some basic insight into
    patterns that haven't been explored yet. Outside of this, however, think of this
    as an addition to the base-game before tackling other charts that require more
    keys, or expand upon the base game in more challenging ways.
